				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				9.10
			</span></i>; <i>reckon up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.2.35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύθους ἀ.</span>”
				<i>recount,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1453a18
				</span></i>
			:—
