				Alex.
			</span></i> Aphr.<i><span class="en">
				<u>in SE</u>
				64.11
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>reckon</i> or <i>pay back, repay,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.1.42
			</span></i>, D H.<i><span class="en">
				4.10
			</span></i>,etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>secure payment of</i> a sum owing, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				1.32
			</span></i>, cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				22.1122
			</span></i>; but, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			=
			
				Act.
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				164
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Top.</u>
